    "topic_id": 2028112,
    "poster_id": 224483,
    "post_rendered": "For every positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08ff8ea020546fb6e8c90abbfb0b50802eee802d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" > prove that there exist a real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" > so that for every positive integer <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bf4f45d6b87b2afb277a1d2746e8b3a2850e281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;1398$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" >:</span><br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4ec1414bc654580df10b56c6857b20efe0a9816.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"$$\\left\\{x^n\\right\\}&lt;\\left\\{x^{n-1}\\right\\} \\Longleftrightarrow k\\mid n.$$\"  width=\"201\" height=\"22\" ><br>\n<i>Proposed by Mohammad Amin Sharifi</i>",
    "post_canonical": "For every positive integer $k>1$ prove that there exist a real number $x$ so that for every positive integer $n<1398$:\n$$\\left\\{x^n\\right\\}<\\left\\{x^{n-1}\\right\\} \\Longleftrightarrow k\\mid n.$$\n\n[i]Proposed by Mohammad Amin Sharifi[/i]",
